// Generated from reviewed wiki-source Markdown. Do not edit by hand.
export const wikiPages = [{"title":"Beta Status","yueTitle":"測試狀態","href":"wiki/Beta-Status.html","text":"  Beta Status\n\nThe public Roblox beta is being prepared. A native Studio Save to File and independent reopen have source, root, service-property and Terrain-voxel parity evidence for the selected development scene. Selected local Play input reached plot Claim, Build, starter construction and some farm, factory, animal and amenity routes.\n\nThe beta is not called published or verified until a specific Roblox place version passes a fresh public join, responsive controls, durable leave and rejoin, and account-isolation acceptance. The 56 earned building and rotation routes and the concurrent 14-building arrangement also remain open. No play link appears on the website as a finished beta while that proof is absent.\n\nThe public  development gallery  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-gallery/  contains reviewed captures. A gallery image proves only the scene and version recorded with it, not a live-server release.\n\n  測試狀態\n\n公開 Roblox 測試版仲喺準備中。指定開發場景嘅原生 Studio「儲存成檔案」同獨立重新開啟，已有原始碼、根節點、服務屬性同地形體素一致性證據。選定嘅本機操作亦成功認領地塊、打開建造流程、完成起步建築，並觸及部分農場、工場、動物同設施流程。\n\n要有指定 Roblox 場景版本通過全新公開加入、操作反應、持久化離開再加入，同帳戶隔離驗收，先會稱公開測試版已推出或已驗證。56 條賺取建築與旋轉擺放路線，以及 14 棟建築同時擺放嘅配置，仍未完成。缺乏呢啲證據之前，網站唔會將遊玩連結當成已完成嘅測試版提供。\n\n公開嘅 開發圖片集  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-gallery/ 有經過審核嘅畫面。每張圖只證明佢所記錄嘅場景同版本，唔證明已有公開伺服器版本。\n"},{"title":"Buildings and Production","yueTitle":"建築同生產","href":"wiki/Buildings-and-Production.html","text":"  Buildings and Production\n\nThe 14 construction definitions are silo, barn, personal market, supplies shop, restaurant, depot, hotel, restroom, feedmill, bakery, dairy, sugar mill, loom and preserves workshop. Every construction card in the  live guide  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ guide  gives its level, exact coin and material cost, current timer and role. The free silo, wheat-funded barn and feedmill have selected local Play routes. A complete 14-building concurrent layout and all earned rotations remain unverified.\n\nThe feedmill makes four kinds of animal feed. The bakery makes bread, carrot cake and truffle tart; the dairy makes butter and cheese; the sugar mill makes sugar; the loom makes wool cloth; the preserves workshop makes strawberry jam and apple preserves. Each of the 13 recipe cards lists the input quantity, output quantity, station, level and current timer. Definitions are separate from published production proof.\n\nThe four upgrade definitions are barn capacity, silo capacity, production queue and land. The current land rule increases the animal placement allowance by one per tier, subject to a cap of 16; it does not increase the construction limit. The guide records each maximum tier, cost formula and capacity effect. A recipe's listed unlock level can precede the level needed to grow an ingredient or build its station: chicken feed lists level 1 but self-grown corn requires level 2, and butter lists level 6 but the owned dairy requires level 8. Purchases are server-authoritative; an incomplete request or unavailable saved profile must not be shown as a successful upgrade.\n\n  建築同生產\n\n14 種建築定義包括筒倉、穀倉、私人市場、用品店、餐廳、貨運站、酒店、洗手間、飼料廠、麵包店、乳製品工場、糖廠、織布機同果醬工場。 網上指南  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ guide 每張建築卡都列出等級、準確金幣同材料成本、目前計時器，以及用途。免費筒倉、用小麥換取嘅穀倉同飼料廠有選定嘅本機操作路線。全部 14 棟同時擺放，以及所有賺取後旋轉擺放路線，仍未驗證。\n\n飼料廠製作四種動物飼料。麵包店製作麵包、紅蘿蔔蛋糕同松露撻；乳製品工場製作牛油同芝士；糖廠製糖；織布機織羊毛布；果醬工場製作士多啤梨果醬同蘋果蜜餞。13 張食譜卡逐張列出原料數量、產出數量、工作站、等級同目前計時器。資料定義同公開伺服器上嘅生產證明係兩回事。\n\n四種升級定義係穀倉容量、筒倉容量、生產佇列同土地。目前土地規則每升一級增加一個動物擺放名額，上限係 16；唔會增加建築名額。指南列出各項最高級數、成本公式同容量效果。食譜列出嘅解鎖等級，可能早過自己種到原料或者建到工作站嘅等級：雞飼料列等級 1，但自己種粟米要等級 2；牛油列等級 6，但自家乳製品工場要等級 8。購買由伺服器決定；請求未完成或者存檔未能使用時，唔應顯示升級成功。\n"},{"title":"Crops and Items","yueTitle":"農作物同物品","href":"wiki/Crops-and-Items.html","text":"  Crops and Items\n\nThe source defines seven planting routes: wheat, corn, carrot, soybean, sugarcane, strawberry and apple saplings. Each crop consumes one seed or sapling, has a level requirement and timer, and returns its listed yield plus XP and one planting supply if storage permits. Wheat has selected native harvest evidence. Other crop routes remain in development until their full earned and published paths are proved.\n\nThe item catalogue contains 31 named goods: seven planting supplies, seven harvested crops, four animal products, four feeds and nine made goods. Values on the  live guide  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ guide  come from a source snapshot, not a promise that a public sale or order is currently available. Its search can locate every individual item and show how it is obtained and used.\n\nThe animals are chicken, cow, sheep and pig. Each requires its matching feed and has a collection timer and product. The chicken has selected local purchase, feeding and collection evidence; the others need full earned and live acceptance. See  Buildings and Production  Buildings-and-Production.md .\n\n  農作物同物品\n\n原始資料定義咗七條種植路線：小麥、粟米、紅蘿蔔、黃豆、甘蔗、士多啤梨同蘋果樹苗。每種農作物要用一粒種子或者一棵樹苗，亦有等級要求同計時器；倉庫有位先會收返所列產量、經驗值，同一份補充種植用品。小麥有選定嘅原生收成證據。其他農作物嘅完整賺取流程同公開版本未經證實，所以仍屬開發中。\n\n物品圖鑑有 31 種有名貨品：七種種植用品、七種收成作物、四種動物產品、四種飼料，同九種加工貨品。 網上指南  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ guide 顯示嘅價值嚟自一份原始資料快照，唔保證目前可以喺公開伺服器出售或者交訂單。搜尋功能可以搵到每件物品，睇佢點樣取得同使用。\n\n動物有雞、牛、羊同豬。每種都要相應飼料，亦有收集計時器同產品。買雞、餵雞同收蛋已有選定嘅本機證據；其餘仍要完成賺取流程同公開版本驗收。詳情睇 建築同生產  Buildings-and-Production.md 。\n"},{"title":"Getting Started","yueTitle":"開始上手","href":"wiki/Getting-Started.html","text":"  Getting Started\n\nChoose a plot, use the owned management board to place starter soil, plant a seed, wait for its current timer, and harvest. Starter soil is free. Owned objects can be rearranged without an extra placement charge, while a new building uses earned materials, coins, its level unlock, and a construction timer.\n\nWheat is the first crop. Its current timer is five seconds under compact pacing, and one harvest yields three wheat and five XP when storage has room. Three wheat and 40 coins pay for the first barn. Five wheat and 70 coins pay for a feedmill. A free silo has a 30-second legacy timer, compacted to five seconds. The actual entry and interaction paths have only selected local Studio evidence, so published-server behavior must still be checked.\n\nThe  live guide  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ guide  lists each cost, unlock, timer, product and evidence status. See  Crops and Items  Crops-and-Items.md  and  Buildings and Production  Buildings-and-Production.md .\n\n  開始上手\n\n先揀一塊地並認領，再用自己嘅管理板放起步泥田、播種、等候目前計時器，最後收成。起步泥田免費。已擁有嘅物件可以重新擺位，唔使再畀一次放置費；新建築則要達到解鎖等級，並付出賺返嚟嘅材料、金幣，同等候建造計時器。\n\n小麥係第一種農作物。按目前壓縮節奏，生長計時係五秒；倉庫有位時，每次收成會得到三份小麥同五點經驗值。第一間穀倉要三份小麥同 40 金幣；飼料廠要五份小麥同 70 金幣。免費筒倉原有 30 秒計時，壓縮後係五秒。實際入內同操作流程暫時只有選定嘅本機 Studio 證據，公開伺服器行為仍要再驗證。\n\n 網上指南  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ guide 列出每項成本、解鎖條件、計時器、產品同證據狀態。亦可睇 農作物同物品  Crops-and-Items.md 以及 建築同生產  Buildings-and-Production.md 。\n"},{"title":"Farm Tycoon Field Guide","yueTitle":"Farm Tycoon 農場指南","href":"wiki/Home.html","text":"  Farm Tycoon Field Guide\n\nThe  live field guide  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/  has a searchable explanation of every defined crop, seed, item, animal, recipe, building, and upgrade. It also carries the  world lore  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ lore  and current beta status. This wiki provides stable reference pages and maintenance notes. The website is documentation, not a playable version of Farm Tycoon.\n\n-  Getting Started  Getting-Started.md \n-  Crops and Items  Crops-and-Items.md \n-  Buildings and Production  Buildings-and-Production.md \n-  World Lore  World-Lore.md \n-  Beta Status  Beta-Status.md \n\n  Evidence language:   \"Observed locally\" means a selected route was actually exercised in Studio. \"In development\" means a definition exists but the full route is unverified. Neither label means that public-server behavior has passed.\n\n  Farm Tycoon 農場指南\n\n 網上農場指南  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ 可以搜尋每種已定義嘅農作物、種子、物品、動物、食譜、建築同升級，亦有 世界故事  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ lore 同目前公開測試版嘅進度。呢度係方便長期查閱嘅百科頁同維護說明。呢個網站係文件，唔係可以直接玩嘅 Farm Tycoon。\n\n-  開始上手  Getting-Started.md \n-  農作物同物品  Crops-and-Items.md \n-  建築同生產  Buildings-and-Production.md \n-  世界故事  World-Lore.md \n-  測試狀態  Beta-Status.md \n\n  證據標籤：  「本機已觀察」即係指定流程喺 Studio 真正操作過。「開發中」即係有資料定義，但完整流程仲未驗證。兩個標籤都唔代表公開伺服器嘅行為已經通過測試。\n"},{"title":"World Lore","yueTitle":"世界故事","href":"wiki/World-Lore.html","text":"  World Lore\n\nThe valley began with a shared arrival hall and empty fields. New farmers chose a plot, placed the first soil, and learned what the land returned when they gave it time.\n\nWheat paid for the first barn. The barn sheltered animals; the feedmill gave those animals a daily rhythm. The depot, market, bakery, and later workshops grew around the same idea: the town becomes real when its people can use the doors, work the machines, and bring something home.\n\nOlder equipment remains in the depot because its makers left practical lessons behind. Every shutter, counter, and room should have a purpose. Ordinary harvests and careful construction shape the town's story.\n\nThis is original setting fiction for the public guide. It does not claim that unfinished quests, characters, or buildings are already playable. Read the  complete lore section on the website  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ lore .\n\n  世界故事\n\n山谷最初只有大家共用嘅接待大堂同一片空田。新嚟嘅農夫揀一塊地、放低第一塊泥田，慢慢學識土地需要時間，先會有收成。\n\n第一間穀倉靠小麥換返嚟。穀倉畀動物遮風擋雨；飼料廠令照顧動物成為每日嘅節奏。貨運站、市場、麵包店同之後嘅工場，都圍住同一個念頭起：村民行得入門、用得到機器、帶得啲嘢返屋企，條村先至真正活起嚟。\n\n貨運站留住舊器材，因為造佢哋嘅人留下實在嘅經驗。每道閘、每張櫃檯、每間房都應該有用途。普通嘅收成同用心嘅建造，就係條村故事嘅底。\n\n呢段係公開指南原創嘅世界設定，唔代表未完成嘅任務、角色或者建築已經可以玩。可以去網站睇 完整故事段落  https://ding-ding-projects.github.io/roblox-farm-tycoon-guide/ lore 。\n"}];
